        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ä-mä-dhi-ya gat Yo-ac kuäär Juda lɔ̱ɔ̱ tëk kɛ run wäl dhieec kɛ kɔr li̱eth Yo-ac gat Yɛ-ɣo-a-ɣadh kuäär thuk duëli kuec caam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua duɔth lätnikɛ ni tukädɛ cu mäni guutdɛ gɔ̱a̱r rɛy buɔk kua̱ri Juda kɛnɛ kua̱r I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikɛ gua̱a̱th ëë pälɛ guur Kuɔth Nhial, cua jɛ ca̱p mi jiääk kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kä cuɛ rɔ bar kä La-kic. Kä duundɛ ɣöö cua naath lɔ̱ jäk kä kɔɔrɛ, kä La-kic, kä cua jɛ wä näk ɛn wi̱ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ jɛ nööŋ kɛ jio̱o̱k tuɔ̱ruɔ̱k, cua jɛ ben kony kɛɛl kɛ gua̱ni därwec Dee-bid.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.28"
            ]
          }
        }
